WEBVTT

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:01.590
U-um, are you all ri-!?

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:02.820
I-It hurts!!

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:03.550
U-um, are you all ri-!?

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.790
Wha...what's wrong with you!?

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.210
...It's gone.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:49.990
...Extract it.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:14.750
Wh-what the hell is that!?

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:41.620
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.750
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:47.950
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.860
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:51.660
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:54.060
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:58.120
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:02.330
hurueru sora
Quaking sky

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:08.130
kazewa naniwo tsugeru
What is the wind telling me?

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:13.780
tadashii datoka soujanai toka
Right or wrong

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:16.850
kudaranai ronsouwa
Nonsensical arguments

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:19.350
kieya shinai kedo
Never go away

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:23.960
shinjita kotowo shinjinuku koto
Believe what you believe in

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:27.200
sono sakini bokurawa
At the end of it all

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.700
hikari mitsukeru darou
We will find the light

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:34.770
saa tokihanate ima
Now is the time to release it

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.740
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:39.970
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:44.170
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.010
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:47.880
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:50.180
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:54.710
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:39.930
We've got Yuji.

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:44.300
...No. We've yet to collect Tasaka Yumi's Persona.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.570
He ran into that officer.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.310
Yes... I understand.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.550
He got away.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:57.150
He's Special A. His powers are innate.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:01.190
Since he saw us, we should take his as
soon as we can. I'll handle that officer.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:04.990
He's from the Ayanagi Police, right?
Remember what he looks like?

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.510
It... it really came out...

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.610
This is ridiculous.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.580
Seriously... Who were they?

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:38.450
What was that?

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:04.780
Oh, it's getting late... I better go wake him up...

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:10.560
Niichan, you're gonna be late.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.190
You'll be sore if you sleep on the floor like that.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.830
That dream again?

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:23.100
Y-yeah! But, it came out for real!

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:26.670
From my head, or my back... I mean, from inside...

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.840
Like, booooom!

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.040
Did you win this time?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:34.010
What? Y-yeah... Then some lady started chasing me.

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.780
She flew through the sky, like, zoom! And...

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:43.460
You should go wash your face and wake up.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:45.430
You're late.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:47.660
I'm sorry. I'll get up earlier tomorrow.

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:51.170
We should take turns doing
chores since we're living together.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:54.870
Like, grocery shopping and cooking...
You know, like one of those shows...

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.870
I don't watch TV. I wouldn't know.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:07:01.270
Huh? Yeah. You know what I'm talking about.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.880
I've done all the paperwork for your school.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.440
But you both should leave this place soon.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.450
Hey! Aniki!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:14.090
Wait! Why do we have to leave our own house!?

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:17.020
Not the house. This town.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.660
W-wait! ...Why!?

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:21.400
Oh... Is it about your girlfriend?

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.690
We'll just go out whenever you bring her over!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:28.930
Hey! Aniki!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.100
What's wrong with him?

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:54.490
He's up!

00:07:57.930 --> 00:08:01.030
Kanzato-kun? Kanzato Shin-kun?

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:05.870
You okay? You're at school.

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:09.330
Naginomori High School, 2-A.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:14.150
Crap. Is math class first?

00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:15.720
It's already lunch time.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.080
What!? Have I been?

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:21.210
You sleep pretty heavily. Even the
teacher was almost impressed.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.230
Did you bring lunch?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.290
Oh. No...

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.430
You should hurry to the cafeteria, then.

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:31.170
Oh, it might be better to just
go to the snack stand now.

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.800
Oh, oh... Thanks. Where is it?

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:38.830
Oh, right... Fine. I'll take you there.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.340
Um... What is it?

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:42.380
Have we... met somewhere before?
Um... What is it?

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:46.210
Have we... met somewhere before?

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:51.450
Aww, stop! I've never had anyone do this...

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.550
I mean, who says stuff like that nowadays!?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.890
No, seriously...

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:56.480
Gimme your e-mail address.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:58.620
Hold on!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:02.800
You won't find the pastries you
want at the stand now, new kid.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:05.990
Y'know, you've got some nerve...

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.900
Who cares, Takuro?

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:13.540
Listen... Who gives out her
e-mail address to some stranger?

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:15.540
He's my classmate.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.850
But! It took you so long to give it to me!

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:18.710
Um... Sakakiba-kun...

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:20.210
Shut up! What now!?

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:21.810
Oh... Morimoto...

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.950
U-um... They're...

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.650
Seniors?

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.560
What do you guys need?

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:31.990
Don't! It's probably Shadow Extraction again.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.500
We're told not to do it. It's dangerous.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.760
Be quiet. Who cares?

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:39.030
I'm not gonna help you if anything happens.

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:42.200
You've heard about the missing kids, right?

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.800
Just don't do it!

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:44.290
Sorry, she can get annoying like this sometimes.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.770
Shadow Extraction?

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:52.250
...We will devote ourselves to this
investigation and use all the power we have...

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:57.780
Do they really think this scripted speech
will reassure the victims' family members!?

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.750
Mr. Ito, please restrain yourself.

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:02.520
You may be excused.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:03.720
However...

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:07.350
Understood.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.100
I already know...

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:17.230
they're never gonna get better.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:23.380
They'll continue to get weaker until
their bodies just give up and die.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:27.650
Each student you ordered to be taken into
protective custody has been attacked.

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:29.810
By some... unknown power...

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:35.460
Following your vague orders blindly, four
of my members have turned into zombies...

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:38.150
Apathy Syndrome is what you guys like to call it.

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:43.250
Do we not have the right to know the truth, Chief?

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.530
Isn't there anything we can do to help?

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.200
No.

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:53.310
So you just used the people you found
useless as your little chess pieces.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:54.680
I'd like to prevent any more casualties.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:56.140
We'll take care of the rest...

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.610
The hell you will!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:05.280
If you're gonna keep flaunting your authority
in our faces, then I've got a plan, too.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:22.340
I'm glad Tasaka Yumi regained consciousness.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:25.110
However, even if she seems to
have recovered from the shock,

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:27.340
she will keep suffering from severe PTSD.

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:30.880
She's wounded from the forced
extraction of her Persona.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:34.710
It isn't possible to regain
her A Latency ever again.

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:39.250
Please, give her your best
care. I'll do anything to help.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.750
Yeah...

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.390
That's him. No doubt.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.060
He pulls out a crazy one.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.060
The chief of police? What a surprise.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:53.560
He looks young... Twenty-seven,
maybe twenty-eight.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:57.630
In that case... Interesting...

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:03.740
The officials are trying to protect
some of the students on our list.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:09.050
...Whether attempted or carried out, none
of these incidents have been made public.

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:12.190
It would be a waste if we just extract and kill him.

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:14.750
I'll have to talk to Kujo-san about this.

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:25.500
Going on a date with the inspector?

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:28.260
I wonder if they're going to look
at last night's Reverse victim?

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.980
Narasaki, trail the Chief starting today.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.610
Should we really go that far?

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.550
I'll pay you for the overtime.

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:40.310
Any more problems?

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:41.980
Fine...

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.650
It's the same again.

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:46.980
A gruesome inside-out corpse.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.250
I'd like to take a look anyway.

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:51.610
I don't mind, but...

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.260
Anything on the Toyama Bay incident?

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:56.930
Who told you about that?

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.270
They disappeared, right?

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:00.230
The crew members on the submarine.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.140
I'm just interested.

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:05.810
Humans vanishing in a closed space, underwater.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:08.170
In a way, that's the best
definition of an unnatural death.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:09.810
That's inappropriate to say.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.850
It's a professional observation.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.510
I haven't heard anything else about it.

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.110
I see...

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.250
It hasn't changed since ten years ago.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:27.280
...You're right.

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.440
Aren't you gonna live with them?

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:53.640
Your brothers. Isn't it about time?

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.290
I wouldn't say we're family.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:01.430
Especially, just with brothers...

00:14:02.430 --> 00:14:05.560
You don't want them to live in this town?

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.190
That was my intention.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:23.240
Thank you!

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:27.240
Why did you try to run away?

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:31.660
Because I did that to them.
They won't leave me alone.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:32.790
Did you beat them up?

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:36.400
No. I just did a quick Shadow Extraction on them.

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:39.170
They promised to give me
a Makorin figure if I did it.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:43.040
Isn't that the thing Kayano-san
was warning you about?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:46.010
Yeah... I mean, it's not too different from drugs.

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.340
Drugs?

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:49.310
It's something like it.

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:54.880
It just became popular recently.
I guess it helps relieve stress.

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.420
I wasn't interested at first...

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:03.590
But when I tried it on other people,
they told me I was really good.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.890
Now people come ask me to do
it to them from time to time.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.730
What about those missing kids?

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:12.170
Oh... I guess there were a few
other kids who were good, too...

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:15.100
but they up and vanished or something...

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:20.800
Megumi's just worried I'll disappear
and she would actually miss me.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:26.080
Hey, why don't you try
Shadow Extraction out on me?

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:28.420
What? No way. It's sort of creepy.

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:29.820
Everything'll be fine!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.590
Where does that confidence come from?

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:33.250
Besides, I don't even know how...

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.410
It's easy. I'll teach you.

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:38.390
Like this?

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:40.990
Just a little more... Yeah...

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.030
Like that... Good.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.330
And keep it just like that.

00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:49.330
I'm ready.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:33.840
Th-this again!

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:10.320
Can we try again?

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:11.280
What!?

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.690
You saw that awesome thing come out, too, right!?

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.260
Unbelievable...

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:18.890
C'mon, I'm begging you. Once more.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:19.730
No way.

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:20.630
Why not?

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:23.490
Because... It's too dangerous!

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:25.690
No fun.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:30.330
Geez, who cares? It's not like he loses anything...

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:33.540
Too dangerous? It's my body...

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:36.940
Hey, Morimoto.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.110
Sakakiba-kun...

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:39.780
What's up? What are you doing here?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.870
U-um, I have a favor to ask...

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:46.040
Um, well...

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:50.310
Will you...

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:57.460
Do Shadow Extraction on me?

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:58.470
...What?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.640
I've been interested since the
beginning of freshman year.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.630
I've wanted you to do it to me for a long time...

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:08.740
Ugh... S-sure... Real quick, then.

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:11.040
Thank you!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:13.980
But this isn't a good place to!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.710
Oh, Takuro?

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:17.950
M-Megumi!

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:20.890
Um, well, you know? Yeah, dinner!

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:23.410
We were talking about getting dinner together!

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:26.730
Dinner? I'll come, too!

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:31.700
I didn't realize you two were close...

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:33.100
Well...
U-um...

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:36.090
Well, no! We aren't...

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:38.540
Good job, Takuro!

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:41.880
It's not like that! Why would you
come along if you thought it was!?

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:44.970
Oh yeah. Should we get Kanzato-kun, too?

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.750
Niichan, what are you doing here?

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:55.490
Jun... the same to you. Isn't this
out of your way from school?

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:57.720
I wanted to explore the town.

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:00.290
How's your new school?

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:04.790
It's just the first day. It's not much
different from anywhere else.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:12.810
That was good!

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.010
Yeah... You sure did eat a lot.

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:18.580
You don't have to try to impress
us. We can split the cost!

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:19.880
S-sure...

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.110
Hey, do you guys wanna go in there?

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:28.160
This place has the best honey toast!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.620
You're gonna eat more?

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:40.630
You low-life!

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:51.600
You saw that, huh?

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:55.250
Sorry... I should've kept it to myself.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.420
No, it's fine.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:01.320
He hurt one of my friends, and I couldn't take it.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:04.220
Not that I was able to get him back after all.

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.830
You're such a man...

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:08.300
I'm a girl.

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:10.730
Yeah, I know...

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:18.330
You're awesome, Megumi-san!

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:21.670
All right!

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.850
I gotta go to the bathroom.

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:30.740
Oh, me too.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:39.650
Hey, Shin, let's do Shadow Extraction now.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:44.530
Anyway, what was that? It came out of you, too.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.700
Morimoto-san, I heard you
do Shadow Extraction a lot.

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.310
You should be careful.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.270
I know... But for some reason, I...

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:57.080
No, it's nothing.

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.470
I'm getting... sleepy...

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:03.710
Are you all right?

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:05.620
Yeah...

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.560
You girls wanna do Shadow Extraction?

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:13.990
Sto-!!

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.570
...Persona.

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:53.170
omotai kusariwo
The heavy chain

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:58.870
ima hazushite agemashou
I will take it off for you

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:04.180
jiyuuni naretara
Once you're free

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:11.250
kokowo habataite yukeruwa
You'll be able to fly away

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:17.790
atashiga samatage
I stood in your way

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:26.570
ubatte kita madaminu sekai e
and took that world you haven't seen

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:30.770
tamerau nonara
If you're going to hesitate

00:22:30.770 --> 00:22:39.440
huriharatte ageru sono udewo
I will free that arm for you

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:44.120
soshite tookue
Then to faraway

00:22:44.120 --> 00:22:50.020
dekirudake tookue
As far away as possible

00:22:50.020 --> 00:22:53.630
aishiteruno
"I love you"

00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:57.200
ikanaideyo
"Don't leave me"

00:22:57.200 --> 00:23:04.570
koware chaukara
I will break

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:16.550
Suppression. Liberation.

00:23:17.350 --> 00:23:20.010
A vivid dream in-between.

00:23:20.490 --> 00:23:24.320
Another mask is peeled free.

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:30.460
Bursting flames under the name of enforcement.

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:35.470
A spiritual sword ends the forced stagnation.

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:40.200
A deep sleep. Desiring a connection.
